Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool2 to see if a smaller, more diverse subset improves over full mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 to see if a learned meta‑weighting improves over the simple mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error on pool2 to see if a slightly larger diverse subset improves over the current mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool3 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger but focused pool improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the small, high‑performing pool1 using softmax‑negative‑error weights to see if a different weighting scheme improves over the mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

